      "get": {
        "operationId": "v2_prices_index",
        "summary": "Index history",
        "tags": [
          "Markets and macro"
        ],
        "description": "Deployed preview. What did it trade at? Daily history (split-adjusted by default), latest quote, sessions, indices, B3 FORWARD prints.\n\none source index code (IBOV, IFIX, ...), levels as published (total-return indices, not adjusted). With no id the SQL refusal names the codes held.\n\nThis playground selects `index` on `GET /prices`. See the [full resource reference](/api-docs/v2/reference/prices) for all variants.",
        "x-mint": {
          "href": "/api-docs/v2/operations/prices/index"
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "kind",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Selects index history.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "index"
              ],
              "default": "index"
            },
            "example": "index"
          },
          {
            "name": "freq",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "kind history, index, forward. month: the last session of each month, selected from the daily rows (no interpolation; a month with no session has no row). Default: day.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "day",
                "month"
              ],
              "default": "day"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "By kind: history, latest take a B3 ticker (PETR4); session takes a B3 ticker (none: every ticker of the session); index takes a B3 index code (IBOV, IFIX, ...); forward takes a B3 FORWARD-segment ticker. With no id, kinds history, latest read api.research_universe (what SILO holds). Default: none.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "from",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Start date (YYYY-MM-DD). Omit to use this resource's default window.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "to",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "End date (YYYY-MM-DD). Omit to use the latest complete period.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Rows per page, capped by your tier. Check next_page_url and meta.tier_cap_reached for incomplete results.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "cursor",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "Cursor from next_page_url. Send it alone; it preserves the original filters.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "fields",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "core: a short set (history: ticker, trade_date, close_adj or close, isin). all: every column the endpoint publishes. index and forward publish few columns, so core is all of them. Default: core.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "core",
                "all"
              ],
              "default": "core"
            }
          }
        ],
